The firsts is a list of 1, and 2.
The seconds is a list of -2, and -1.
The thirds is a list of -1, and 2.
The fourths is a list of 0, and 2.
The last is the last position of firsts.
The found is 0.
For every alpha from 0 to last.
For every beta from 0 to last.
For every gamma from 0 to last.
For every delta from 0 to last.
The total is item alpha of firsts plus item beta of seconds plus item gamma of thirds plus item delta of fourths.
If total is 0, add 1 to found.

Show found.
